{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02942","headline":"奉和人日重宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制 · 崔日用","name":"奉和人日重宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新年宴乐坐东朝，钟鼓铿鍠大乐调。\n金屋瑶筐开宝胜，花笺彩笔颂春椒。\n曲池苔色冰前液，上苑梅香雪里娇。\n宸极此时飞圣藻，微臣窃拚预闻韶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔日用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}